MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The heat shrink assortment fits my battery holders and circuit boards because it would help insulate soldered leads across small electronics projects.",
    "The digital caliper would help me check component sizes and mounting clearances. The casters also connect to a previous purchase, although I have less reason to buy another set now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The heavy battery lugs and sealed wire splices involve electrical connections, but their cable sizes and permanent connections do not fit my small, removable breadboard and relay setups.",
    "The three filament choices assume a printing need that my history does not establish. The acrylic sheet and feeler gauge also require specific projects I do not currently have."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in building circuits seems to have been stretched into an interest in almost any workshop supply, even when it serves a different task.",
    "My previous caster purchase seems to have been treated as a reason to buy more, without considering that the earlier set may already meet my need."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "Small component sizes and removable prototype connections matter more to me than a broad connection to electrical work.",
    "I am more likely to choose something with a clear use alongside parts I already have, such as insulating leads or measuring clearances, than material that requires an unestablished project or machine."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognize my practical electronics interests but stretch them too far into unrelated supplies and repeat purchases."
}
